   desc="Published in 1871 and the first English scientific romance of a superior underground race: the discovery of a subterranean civilisation powered by a mysterious force.",
   plot="An American mining engineer descends into a vast cavern and finds the Vril-ya, a race of winged superhuman beings who live in a socialist utopia powered by 'vril'; he learns their language and customs, is nearly married to a Vril-ya woman, and escapes back to the surface with a warning about the future of humanity.",
